@startuml
!include theme.puml
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
hide empty members
class PatternTools <<Swing>> {
  -mode : Mode
  -stampTimer : Timer
  ~setPlacementGuard(guard)
}
class BoardEditor {
  +capture(name, area)
  +place(pattern, origin)
  +beginStroke() / endStroke()
  +undo()
}
class PatternLibrary {
  +save(pattern)
  +patterns()
}
class PatternTemplate <<immutable>> {
  -name : String
  -cells : boolean[][]
}
class PlacePatternCommand <<Command>> {
  -added : Set<Point>
  ~execute() / undo()
  ~include(next)
}
class PatternCells <<adapter role>> {
  ~isAlive(cell)
  ~setAlive(cell, alive)
}
class PatternPath <<utility>> {
  {static} ~visit(from, to, visitor)
}
interface Cell <<existing>> {
  +isAliveAt(row, column)
  +userClicked(point, surface)
  +createMemento()
}
class Neighborhood <<existing Composite>>
class Resident <<existing Leaf>>

PatternTools --> BoardEditor : 편집 위임
PatternTools --> PatternLibrary : 목록·저장
PatternTools ..> PatternPath : 이동 보간
PatternLibrary "1" --> "0..*" PatternTemplate
BoardEditor ..> PatternTemplate : 생성 / 배치
BoardEditor "1" --> "0..100" PlacePatternCommand : history
PlacePatternCommand --> PatternCells : 필요한 셀만 편집
PatternCells --> Cell : 기존 계약 사용
BoardEditor ..> Cell : 캡처 Memento 조회
Neighborhood ..|> Cell
Resident ..|> Cell
Neighborhood o-- Cell : 하위 셀
@enduml
